{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】天主教香港教區主教周守仁樞機，呼籲各堂區在宏福苑火災一周年當日為亡者奉獻彌撒。</p>\n<p>周守仁向各堂區及信仰團體負責人發信，呼籲在本月26日火災一周年當日為亡者奉獻彌撒，亦在隨後主日彌撒中加入相關祈禱意向。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:03:23.033025+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:35:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:41.313397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:41.313397+00:00","content_hash":"ecbd2e50fb7bb100467f7d04cc1c406878536a4508cb131a84da90aa5999ecfe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}